    "body": "# What does this PR do ?\n\nPreserve fractional video time coordinates in Qwen3-Omni multimodal RoPE, matching the Hugging Face thinker implementation.\n\nFor example, with `second_per_grids=0.25` and `position_id_per_seconds=13`, the temporal coordinates should be `[0, 3.25, 6.5, 9.75]`. The current `.long()` turns them into `[0, 3, 6, 9]` before RoPE is applied. That also changes subsequent text positions and can change video/audio interleaving when a fractional video position is truncated onto an audio position.\n\n# Changelog\n\n- Use `.float()` instead of `.long()` for expanded temporal coordinates in `get_llm_pos_ids_for_vision`.\n- Add CPU regression coverage for fractional and integral temporal coordinates, video/text position offsets and RoPE deltas, and video/audio interleaving.\n\n# GitHub Actions CI\n\nLocal validation:\n\n- **6 CPU regression cases passed** with the fix; all 6 fail on the original helper. The pure Torch RoPE module was loaded directly, bypassing unrelated model registry imports and Megatron test fixtures because the full Megatron dependency environment is unavailable locally.\n- Independently checked the same expected position IDs/deltas against the actual Hugging Face RoPE helper methods: **all 6 cases match exactly**.\n- `uv run pre-commit run --all-files`: **passed in the sparse checkout** (145 Python files, including both changed files).\n- Strict mypy reports **18 existing errors in the upstream RoPE module**. Comparing with the original source shows the same errors and no newly introduced errors; the new test file has no type errors.\n\nThe full Megatron test environment and GPU training were not exercised locally. As an external contribution, upstream CI requires a maintainer to approve and trigger it following the contributor guide.\n\n# Before your PR is \"Ready for review\"\n\n- [x] Read and followed the contributor guidelines; commit includes DCO sign-off.\n- [x] Added regression tests.\n- [x] Evaluated documentation: no new user-facing API or option, so no documentation update is needed.\n- [x] Evaluated optional components: no dependency or import changes.\n\n# Additional Information\n\nPrimary area: `area:model`; type: `bug`.\n",
